#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:1 be77d4ed594149829a59a42273b59f2c
msgid "SPICE 内核"
msgstr "SPICE Kernels"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:3 5cb13c86c2384e80be197b8b76d37905
msgid ""
"星历动力学（轨道设计的星历修正、轨道保持、轨道预报、时空坐标转换等）需要 NASA SPICE 内核文件；必需内核包括行星历（`.bsp`，如 "
"`de440s.bsp`）与闰秒 （`.tls`，如 `naif0012.tls`）。轨道族生成等纯 CR3BP 工具不读内核。"
msgstr "Ephemeris dynamics (ephemeris correction in orbit design, station keeping, orbit propagation, spacetime transforms, …) require NASA SPICE kernel files; the required kernels include the planetary ephemeris (`.bsp`, e.g. `de440s.bsp`) and leap seconds (`.tls`, e.g. `naif0012.tls`). Pure-CR3BP tools such as orbit family generation never read kernels."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:7 505c4ffc492840dfb46cbb86b02a0908
msgid ""
"**内核已随包分发，开箱即用**：内核全套（含行星历 `.bsp`）经 Git LFS 随仓库 提交，安装包也把它们打进了安装目录的 "
"`resources/kernels/`。桌面用户无需任何 准备步骤；需要另行准备的只剩以下场景。"
msgstr "**Kernels ship with the app — ready out of the box**: the full kernel set (including planetary ephemerides `.bsp`) is committed via Git LFS and bundled into the installer's `resources/kernels/`. Desktop users need no preparation; only the scenarios below call for anything extra."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:11 57e0c12d9bec4991871fb883016b0c37
msgid "内核从哪里来"
msgstr "Where the Kernels Come From"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:13 56bbf5a9899e49c69f4f5995587665ab
msgid ""
"**Git LFS / 安装包**：克隆仓库后 `kernels/` 即已就位（安装版在安装目录）， 应用启动时自动钉到 "
"`$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR`；"
msgstr "**Git LFS / installer**: after cloning, `kernels/` is already in place (in the install directory for the packaged app); on startup the app pins it to `$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` automatically;"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:15 5648aa7d8fe7456f931cfa6d724c034e
msgid ""
"**自动下载**：精简环境（如未拉取 LFS 的 CI）可运行 `uv run python "
"scripts/download_kernels.py`，幂等地拉取全部内核到 `kernels/`；"
msgstr "**Automatic download**: in slim environments (e.g. CI without LFS), run `uv run python scripts/download_kernels.py`, which idempotently fetches all kernels into `kernels/`;"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:17 be9345d8b917412085efb5664a9ebcb8
msgid ""
"**手动下载**：从 e2m2e 的 [`kernels-v1` "
"release](https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e/releases) 下载解压到 sidecar "
"工作目录下的 `kernels/`（开发期即仓库根 `kernels/`， 安装版即安装目录）；"
msgstr ""
"**Manual download**: extract e2m2e's [`kernels-v1` "
"release](https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e/releases) into `kernels/`"
" under the sidecar working directory (the repo root in development, the "
"install directory for the packaged app);"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:21 bdc393e790f14faeabbf2773c272cee6
msgid "**自备数据**：将 `$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` 指向已有内核目录（优先级最高，sidecar 进程继承该环境变量）。"
msgstr ""
"**Bring your own**: point `$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` at an existing kernel "
"directory (highest priority; the sidecar process inherits the variable)."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:24 3cc1f1fcc52549d0b56087d27749be30
msgid "官方来源：[NASA NAIF](https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/data.html)（备用）。"
msgstr ""
"Official source: [NASA NAIF](https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/data.html) "
"(fallback)."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:26 74536b27f0a440dea2013d654595e39b
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:28 aea8cf8ae1d246cfb61c722e6f96ebd2
msgid ""
"**报 \"SPICE(NOLEAPSECONDS)\"**：闰秒内核未加载。确保内核目录含 `naif0012.tls`，或设置 "
"`$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` 后重启应用。"
msgstr ""
"**\"SPICE(NOLEAPSECONDS)\" error**: the leap-second kernel is not loaded."
" Make sure the kernel directory contains `naif0012.tls`, or set "
"`$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` and restart the app."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:30 61a0f628622d42a2928a9a8c02d5e562
msgid "**v3.2.3 及更早版本的 GUI 内核自动引导弹窗已随 PyQt UI 移除**；当前界面 不再提供引导交互，需按上节手动准备内核。"
msgstr "**The GUI kernel-guidance popup of v3.2.3 and earlier was removed with the PyQt UI**; the current interface no longer offers guidance interaction — prepare kernels manually as described above."

